[00:00.000] 作词 : Tienas
[00:00.375] 作曲 : ARB4
[00:00.750] 编曲 : ARB4
[00:01.126][Verse 1: Tienas]
[00:14.751]Looking at the world from the eye of the Horus
[00:16.794]If you're Alexander the Great, then I'm the Porus
[00:19.510]Coming straight from the mud like I'm a Lotus
[00:22.326]Sau haathiyon ka bal kaise sakega tu mujhe rok ab?
[00:25.547]Dekh tu kaise main laduin, tum logon se aise naa daruin
[00:28.598]Taru main jabse main tarun, paani pe chalui main, jaise main varun
[00:31.563]Chahe main jiuin ya maruin, jo karna chahuin main wahi toh karuin
[00:34.254]Aata hai tu naa kareeb, tu bete cheekh, jabhi tak kate na teri yeh jeebh
[00:37.828]Better believe, you gonna bleed, pick up a seat, get all your team
[00:40.620]I'm the king of kings, brother in arms in a battle
[00:43.671]You all gonna die if you act like a Vandal
[00:46.579]Bring the realm to reality from every angle
[00:50.044]This is the public service announcement from
[00:52.618]Mumbai to the rest of the World
[00:55.291]I am a raja, ah
[00:58.257]
[00:58.612][Chorus: Tienas]
[00:59.755]I am the raja, bhidega toh uthega janaza na
