[01:47.791][Verse 2: Tienas]
[01:49.657]Look in my eyes, what do you see? I'm more than an average man
[01:52.356]I'm a maverick, I can grow flowers on a barren land
[01:55.027]Break a moutain with my bare hands and step back
[01:57.678]And cause a literal avalanche, shoot a bullet while it's traveling
[02:00.682]Ashth bhujayein meri jaise main tarantula, naa hai koi tod mera jabse purvajon ka gyan mila
[02:06.112]Mere jaise milega koi na, tu aur, tu aur chahe jo bhi tha, sabki kabr maine khodi
[02:11.377]Kya tum lagaoge boliyan, kam pade goliyan
[02:13.241]Chandragupta, main maurya, yaad dila duin loriyan
[02:16.283]Come to me, and you're just gonna die
[02:17.811]That's really a given, I'm invincible and you're invisible
[02:21.925]See, that's really a difference
[02:23.514]Get out of my way or leave the world, the choice is yours
[02:26.273]I look at my enemies, I play with them, that's what the toys are for
[02:31.732]From Mumbai to the rest of the world
[02:33.996]
[02:34.258][Chorus: Tienas]
[02:34.621]I am the raja, bhidega toh uthega janaza na
[02:40.123]Tu meri taraf aa na, aa gya toh hoga phir tanaza na
[02:45.704]Yeh bharatiya bhasha, phir duniya sunegi yeh tarana na
[02:51.204]'Cause I am the raja, 'cause I am the raja
